<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday slaughter steers and heifers mostly steady in a light test of heifers. USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1100-1500 lbs 62.50-64.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1350 lbs 60.00-62.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 package 1055 lbs 62.00.</p>
</text>
